        <div class="container col-lg-9 col-sm-12 body-container color-overlay">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-12">
                    <div class="general-content">
                            <div class="intro">Operating in Alberta's Capital Market<br /></div>
                                                    <div class="body"><p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Access to current information about companies operating in the capital markets is vital to investors to ensure they can make informed decisions about their investments.</p>
<p>Whether seeking information on securities distributions and continuous disclosure filings, exempt financings, or insider trading reports, these resources are available to help keep investors up to date in a rapidly changing market.</p>
<p>The&nbsp;ASC regulates issuers by reviewing offering documents, monitoring continuous disclosure filings, and making recommendations on applications for exemptive relief from securities laws.</p>
<p>More information about public companies is available on the System for Electronic Document Analysis and Retrieval+ (SEDAR+), where investors can access full-text copies of filed public documents.</p>
<p>For more information on the SEDAR+ filings, please contact our SEDAR+ inquiries line:</p>
<p>Direct Line: 403-297-2489<br />
email: <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#ddaeb8b9bcafadb1a8ae9dbcaebef3bebc"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="8efdebeaeffcfee2fbfdceeffdeda0edef">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></p>
<h4>Frequently Used Financing and Continuous Disclosure Instruments</h4>
<table>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td>44-101</td>
            <td><a href="/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-instruments/44-101">Short Form Prospectus Distributions [NI]&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>44-102&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
            <td><a href="/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-instruments/44-102">Shelf Distributions [NI]&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>44-103&nbsp;<br />
            </td>
            <td><a href="/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-instruments/44-103">Post-Receipt Pricing [NI]&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>45-106</td>
            <td><a href="/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-instruments/45-106">Prospectus Exemptions [NI]</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>51-101</td>
            <td><a href="/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-instruments/51-101">Standards of Disclosure for Oil and Gas Activities [NI]&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>51-102</td>
            <td><a href="/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-instruments/51-102">Continuous Disclosure Obligations [NI]&nbsp;</a><br />
            </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>52-109&nbsp;</td>
            <td><a href="/securities-law-and-policy/regulatory-instruments/52-109">Certification of Disclosure in Issuers' Annual and Interim Filings [NI]&nbsp;</a>&nbsp;</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>
<p><a href="/en/Securities-Law-and-Policy/Regulatory-Instruments"><strong>See all current Regulatory Instruments</strong></a></p>
<p>Videos outlining many of the disclosure and reporting requirements are available in the<a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.asc.ca/en/issuer-regulation/issuer-and-insider-toolkit" target="_blank"> Issuer and Insider Toolkit&nbsp;section</a> of the website.</p></div>

                        


                        


                        


                        


                        

                        

